<title>HONG KONG: Shell Electric interim net down 83 pct.</title>
<headline>Shell Electric interim net down 83 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	  23.0   vs 140.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)   8.0    vs 8.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 nil    vs 413.37 gain</p>
<p>    Net			   83.30  vs 494.26</p>
<p>    Turnover		    693.92 vs 792.21</p>
<p>    Company name		Shell Electric Mfg (Holdings) Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		 October 24-31</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	  November 8</p>
<p>NOTE - Shell Electric is a maker of fans, telephones and microwave ovens.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
